<p>Hi <%= @order.name %>,</p>

<p>Thank you for your order. We have received your request and your order is currently being processed. Below are the details of your purchase:</p>

<ul>
  <% @order.line_items.each do |item| %>
    <li><%= item.quantity %> x <%= truncate(item.product.title, length: 50) %> — <%= number_to_currency(item.product.price) %> each</li>
  <% end %>
</ul>

<p><strong>Total:</strong> <%= number_to_currency(@order.total_price) %></p>

<p>We will notify you by email as soon as your order has shipped. If you have any questions, please reply to this message or contact our support team.</p>

<p>Thank you for choosing Depotify.</p>

<p>Sincerely,<br>
The Depotify Team</p>